  "question": {
    "text": "A body cools from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>50</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>°</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>40</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>°</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn></math> minutes. Its temperature comes down to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>33</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>33</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>°</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> in the next <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn></math> minutes. The temperature of the surroundings is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mi>15 ℃</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mi>20 ℃</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mi>25 ℃</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mi>10 ℃</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Using Newton's law of cooling,<br /><br />log<math><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>K</mi><mi>t</mi></math><br /><br />log <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>40</mn><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>50</mn><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>5</mn></math> .....(i)<br /><br />log <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>33.33</mn><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>40</mn><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>5</mn></math> .....(ii)<br /><br />From Eqs.(i) and (ii),<br /><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>40</mn><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>50</mn><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>33.33</mn><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>40</mn><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />On solving, we get<br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>19.95</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">℃</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>20</mn><mi>℃</mi></math>"
  }
